<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="ja"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="2133230583"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1733157580"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="恋してる自分すら愛せるんだ Acoustic Ver."/><amll:meta key="artists" value="こはならむ"/><amll:meta key="album" value="恋してる自分すら愛せるんだ Acoustic Ver."/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="03:33.750"><div begin="00:02.532" end="03:26.613"><p begin="00:02.532" end="00:05.682" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1">バラバラになりそう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我似要支离破碎的心</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ba ra ba ra ni na ri so u</span></p><p begin="00:05.770" end="00:09.520" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2">僕の心は震えてた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在止不住地颤抖</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">bo ku no ko ko ro ha fu ru e te ta</span></p><p begin="00:09.813" end="00:17.081" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3">君のこと守りたい 心の声は正直だ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">渴望守护你 这是我的真心实意</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki mi no ko to ma mo ri ta i ko ko ro no ko e ha sho u ji ki da</span></p><p begin="00:17.437" end="00:20.654" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4">ダメ元で言えたら<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">若能不管不顾地说出口</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">da me mo to de i e ta ra</span></p><p begin="00:20.682" end="00:24.466" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5">楽に なれるかもしれない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">或许我就能得到解脱了吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ra ku ni na re ru ka mo shi re na i</span></p><p begin="00:24.669" end="00:28.053" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6">踏み出すことできたら<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">若是我可以朝前迈出步伐</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">fu mi da su ko to de ki ta ra</span></p><p begin="00:28.194" end="00:31.977" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7">夢が夢じゃなくなるかな<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那么梦想就能得偿所愿了吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">yu me ga yu me ja na ku na ru ka na</span></p><p begin="00:32.442" end="00:47.777" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8">輝く言葉が 背中を押した<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">璀璨的话语给予了我动力</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka ga ya ku ko to ba ga se na ka wo o shi ta</span></p><p begin="00:48.366" end="00:55.763" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9">隠れてる 心のドアをこじ開けた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就此打开那扇始终隐藏的心门</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka ku re te ru ko ko ro no do a wo ko ji a ke ta</span></p><p begin="00:55.763" end="00:58.193" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10">溢れてくる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">感情满溢</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a fu re te ku ru</span></p><p begin="00:58.308" end="01:03.225" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11">立ち止まらずに駆け出した<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让我步履不停地奔跑起来</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ta chi do ma ra zu ni ka ke da shi ta</span></p><p begin="01:03.319" end="01:05.070" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12">輝いた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">辉煌且柔和的世界</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka ga ya i ta ya wa ra i da</span></p><p begin="01:05.112" end="01:10.762" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13">やわらいだ世界は美しいんだ<span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">se ka i ha u tsu ku shi i n da</span></p><p begin="01:10.784" end="01:12.587" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14">鍵開けた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">打开枷锁 有限的未来</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka gi a ke ta ka gi ra re ta</span></p><p begin="01:12.587" end="01:18.287" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15">限られた未来を拡げるよ今<span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mi ra i wo hi ro ge ru yo i ma</span></p><p begin="01:18.298" end="01:20.081" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16">君に向かう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">指向你的箭头</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki mi ni mu ka u ya ji ru shi ga</span></p><p begin="01:20.153" end="01:25.764" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17">矢印が 自分にも向いてたんだ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">同时也指向了我自己</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ji bu n ni mo mu i te ta n da</span></p><p begin="01:25.802" end="01:31.885" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18">新しい 2人今 はじまる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">全新的我们将由此启程</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a ta ra shi i fu ta ri i ma ha ji ma ru</span></p><p begin="01:46.574" end="01:53.608" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19">喜びの涙が 流れて今言葉になる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">喜悦的泪水滑落后在此刻化作话语</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">yo ro ko bi no na mi da ga na ga re te i ma ko to ba ni na ru</span></p><p begin="01:53.884" end="01:57.234" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20">高鳴る心の声<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">将高亢的心声</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ta ka na ru ko ko ro no ko e</span></p><p begin="01:57.278" end="02:00.997" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21">込めた想い 曝け出せた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">与倾注的心意尽数袒露</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko me ta o mo i sa ra ke da se ta</span></p><p begin="02:01.529" end="02:16.731" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L22">煌めく光が 校舎を包む<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">璀璨光芒笼罩校舍</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki ra me ku hi ka ri ga ko u sha wo tsu tsu mu</span></p><p begin="02:17.478" end="02:19.761" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L23">重ねてる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">特别的“今天”</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka sa ne te ru</span></p><p begin="02:19.816" end="02:24.704" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L24">特別な”きょう”のイメージが<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">历经日积月累后所铸就的愿景</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">to ku be tsu na ” kyo u ” no i me e ji ga</span></p><p begin="02:24.746" end="02:27.255" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25">明日へ向かう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">都奔向了明天</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a su he mu ka u</span></p><p begin="02:27.354" end="02:33.917" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L26">陽射しの中で咲き出した<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">迎着璀璨阳光绚烂绽放</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">hi za shi no na ka de sa ki da shi ta</span></p><p begin="02:34.228" end="02:41.629" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L27">隠れてる 心のドアをこじ開けた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就此打开那扇始终隐藏的心门</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka ku re te ru ko ko ro no do a wo ko ji a ke ta</span></p><p begin="02:41.657" end="02:44.127" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L28">溢れてくる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">感情满溢</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a fu re te ku ru</span></p><p begin="02:44.183" end="02:49.167" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L29">立ち止まらずに駆け出した<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让我步履不停地奔跑起来</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ta chi do ma ra zu ni ka ke da shi ta</span></p><p begin="02:49.219" end="02:50.969" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L30">輝いた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">辉煌且柔和的世界</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka ga ya i ta ya wa ra i da</span></p><p begin="02:50.995" end="02:56.662" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L31">やわらいだ世界は美しいんだ<span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">se ka i ha u tsu ku shi i n da</span></p><p begin="02:56.725" end="02:58.441" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L32">鍵開けた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">打开枷锁 有限的未来</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka gi a ke ta ka gi ra re ta</span></p><p begin="02:58.505" end="03:04.141" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L33">限られた未来を拡げるよ今<span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mi ra i wo hi ro ge ru yo i ma</span></p><p begin="03:04.141" end="03:07.842" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L34">君が好き 恋してる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我喜欢你</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki mi ga su ki</span></p><p begin="03:07.914" end="03:11.698" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35">自分すら愛せるんだ</p><p begin="03:11.732" end="03:19.199" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L36">新しい 2人今 はじまる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">全新的我们将由此启程</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a ta ra shi i fu ta ri i ma ha ji ma ru</span></p><p begin="03:19.262" end="03:26.613" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37">柔らかい 夕暮れが 差し込む<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">色彩柔和的黄昏就此倾洒</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ya wa ra ka i yu u gu re ga sa shi ko mu</span></p></div></body></tt>